Wrapper__C5cNkS ActionsContainer__acCGII"><div class="EditsContainer__yFuvcF"></div><div class="BadgesContainer__muaZQX"><div class="BadgesGroupContainer__W96yO7"></div><div class="ActionsButtonsContainer__ZaEPJ0"><button data-component="IconButton" type="button" aria-label="Actions for emackey&#x27;s comment, 2:59 PM on June 3, 2017" data-testid="comment-header-hamburger" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk CommentActionsIconButton__rdmp8b prc-Button-IconButton-fyge7" data-loading="false" data-no-visuals="true" data-size="small" data-variant="invisible" aria-describedby="_R_fja6ge5gutkr85_" id="_R_ja6ge5gutkr85_"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-kebab-horizontal" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"><path d="M8 9a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3ZM1.5 9a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Zm13 0a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Z"></path></svg></button><span class="prc-TooltipV2-Tooltip-tLeuB" data-direction="n" data-component="Tooltip" role="tooltip" aria-hidden="true" id="_R_fja6ge5gutkr85_">More actions</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Body__scgEjp IssueCommentBody__DGWd7U"><div data-testid="markdown-body" data-team-hovercards-enabled="true" class="markdown-body" data-turbolinks="false"><div class="markdown-body safe-html-box__Uwc6Al"><p dir="auto">Thanks for writing this up <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/cx20/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/cx20">@cx20</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">Just for more context, here are some related info &amp; issues:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>
<p dir="auto">I reported a similar issue on <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/donmccurdy/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/donmccurdy">@donmccurdy</a>'s ThreeJS glTF viewer, <span class="reference"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-issue-closed closed mr-1" title="Closed" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.28 6.78a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06-1.06L7.25 8.69 5.78 7.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2 2a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 0l3.5-3.5Z"></path><path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Zm-1.5 0a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-13 0 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 13 0Z"></path></svg><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="226913969" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/donmccurdy/three-gltf-viewer/issues/10" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/donmccurdy/three-gltf-viewer/issues/10/hovercard" href="https://github.com/donmccurdy/three-gltf-viewer/issues/10">Normal maps don't play nice<span class="issue-shorthand"> donmccurdy/three-gltf-viewer#10</span></a></span>.  But I now think this is a bug in ThreeJS's glTF loader, not in the viewer.  So, this new issue is better placed than my old issue.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">In the above older issue, the model used to face the sky, but later I rotated it to face the horizon.  This makes it easier to see when the reflections aren't right, because the horizon rotates around crazily, as shown above.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">The model's own use of a normal map was confirmed correct by discussion in <span class="reference"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-issue-closed closed mr-1" title="Closed" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.28 6.78a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06-1.06L7.25 8.69 5.78 7.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2 2a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 0l3.5-3.5Z"></path><path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Zm-1.5 0a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-13 0 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 13 0Z"></path></svg><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="227813788" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF/issues/952" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/KhronosGroup/glTF/issues/952/hovercard" href="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF/issues/952">Direction of Y (green) channel in normal maps<span class="issue-shorthand"> KhronosGroup/glTF#952</span></a></span>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">ThreeJS's handling of normal maps was questioned in <span class="reference"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-issue-closed closed mr-1" title="Closed" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.28 6.78a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06-1.06L7.25 8.69 5.78 7.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2 2a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 0l3.5-3.5Z"></path><path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Zm-1.5 0a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-13 0 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 13 0Z"></path></svg><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="227884546" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/11315" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mrdoob/three.js/issues/11315/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/11315">What is three.js's normal map handedness convention?<span class="issue-shorthand"> #11315</span></a></span>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">BabylonJS recently had a similar problem, <a href="https://github.com/sbtron/BabylonJS-glTFLoader/issues/10" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/sbtron/BabylonJS-glTFLoader/issues/10/hovercard">reported here</a>, and <a href="https://github.com/BabylonJS/Babylon.js/pull/2222" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/BabylonJS/Babylon.js/pull/2222/hovercard">fixed here</a>.  Here's a <a href="https://emackey.github.io/BabylonJS-glTFLoader/?model=NormalTangentTest" rel="nofollow">live demo of BabylonJS's glTF 2.0 loader with the fix applied</a>.</p>
</li>
</ul></div></div><div role="toolbar" aria-label="Reactions" class="d-flex gap-1 flex-wrap"><div class="ReactionPopoverAnchor__B84pko"><button data-component="Button" type="button" aria-label="👍 2 reactions" role="switch" aria-checked="false" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk reactionToggleButton__j2dnln" data-inactive="true" data-loading="false" data-size="small" data-variant="default" aria-describedby="_R_1mqge5gutkr85_ _R_1mqge5gutkr85H2_"><span data-component="buttonContent" data-align="center" class="prc-Button-ButtonContent-Iohp5"><span data-component="leadingVisual" class="prc-Button-Visual-YNt2F prc-Button-LeadingVisual-UySKu prc-Button-VisualWrap-E4cnq">👍</span><span data-component="text" class="prc-Button-Label-FWkx3"><span class="sr-only" id="_R_1mqge5gutkr85_">React with 👍</span>2</span></span></button><span class="sr-only" id="_R_1mqge5gutkr85H2_">Reacted by <!-- -->cx20 and mrdoob</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li data-timeline-event-id="MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDExMDg4ODM3OTQ=" data-highlighted-event="false" data-testid="timeline-row-border-MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDExMDg4ODM3OTQ=" data-wrapper-timeline-id="MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDExMDg4ODM3OTQ=" class="Timeline_Item__SPOwOL Timeline_Item_inlineAvatars__agUydM Timeline_Item_indent__x6ciCp Timeline_Item_groupStart__5RUdLa rowInlineAvatars__YXPpBN Timeline-Item prc-Timeline-TimelineItem-QwDVH"><div class="prc-Timeline-TimelineBadgeWrapper-SZw4k"><div class="prc-Timeline-TimelineBadge-u0qSm"><span class="d-flex"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-tag Octicon__kCvIds" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"><path d="M1 7.775V2.75C1 1.784 1.784 1 2.75 1h5.025c.464 0 .91.184 1.238.513l6.25 6.25a1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 2.474l-5.026 5.026a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-2.474 0l-6.25-6.25A1.752 1.752 0 0 1 1 7.775Zm1.5 0c0 .066.026.13.073.177l6.25 6.25a.25.25 